<p>
  Assessment first, then hands-on treatment, then a plan. A typical session runs 30 minutes, and
  your first consultation and the Movement Plan Analysis are a full hour, because there is more to
  work through.
</p>
<p>
  A usual visit starts with a warm-up massage while I get up to date on how you have been. From
